        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862000/extras/8d832b73cda67079f1e869087478800c.poster.avif?t=1756758554\" width=320 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862000/extras/8d832b73cda67079f1e869087478800c.webm?t=1756758554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862000/extras/8d832b73cda67079f1e869087478800c.mp4?t=1756758554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cave of the Skinwalker is a fantasy action-adventure game in which you play as a wizard, warrior, and archer. Harnessing each class’s unique skills, solve puzzles and battle your way through the many regions of Elsana. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862000/extras/70fbb46a538054a40a61fbc15f4d3e80.poster.avif?t=1756758554\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862000/extras/70fbb46a538054a40a61fbc15f4d3e80.webm?t=1756758554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862000/extras/70fbb46a538054a40a61fbc15f4d3e80.mp4?t=1756758554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey starts in Thornridge Academy, where your professors teach your chosen class skills that will enable you to explore different regions of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every area in Elsana has its own characters and stories, containing a vast cast of enemies to fight and dungeons to explore. Visit Mythcross as a wizard to recover the mysterious power from the evil wizard in Weepingwind Tower. Battle through Usville Castle as a warrior to save Unsville and its residents from the evil Falfthazar. Unite Bjornhold and Zamara and free it from the influence of the witches and nobles as an archer. Harness of the power of the Cave of the Skinwalker to change your identity. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862000/extras/667c6a5ff4bc333397a00c7f98361782.poster.avif?t=1756758554\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862000/extras/667c6a5ff4bc333397a00c7f98361782.webm?t=1756758554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862000/extras/667c6a5ff4bc333397a00c7f98361782.mp4?t=1756758554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flip switches, find keys, unlock doors, activate devices, cut ropes, input patterns, jump gaps, and perform many other tasks to unlock new pathways and find your way through the intricate environments of Elsana. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a break from the main story to explore the unique towns, completing side-quests, buying items, and playing mini-games. Help people, and they may gift accessories to expand your inventory. Meet the seamstress and inspire her to design new outfits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the ancient secrets that have shaped this world using the powers of </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Cave of the Skinwalker</i>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862000/extras/8d832b73cda67079f1e869087478800c.poster.avif?t=1756758554\" width=320 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862000/extras/8d832b73cda67079f1e869087478800c.webm?t=1756758554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862000/extras/8d832b73cda67079f1e869087478800c.mp4?t=1756758554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cave of the Skinwalker is a fantasy action-adventure game in which you play as a wizard, warrior, and archer. Harnessing each class’s unique skills, solve puzzles and battle your way through the many regions of Elsana. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862000/extras/70fbb46a538054a40a61fbc15f4d3e80.poster.avif?t=1756758554\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862000/extras/70fbb46a538054a40a61fbc15f4d3e80.webm?t=1756758554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862000/extras/70fbb46a538054a40a61fbc15f4d3e80.mp4?t=1756758554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey starts in Thornridge Academy, where your professors teach your chosen class skills that will enable you to explore different regions of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every area in Elsana has its own characters and stories, containing a vast cast of enemies to fight and dungeons to explore. Visit Mythcross as a wizard to recover the mysterious power from the evil wizard in Weepingwind Tower. Battle through Usville Castle as a warrior to save Unsville and its residents from the evil Falfthazar. Unite Bjornhold and Zamara and free it from the influence of the witches and nobles as an archer. Harness of the power of the Cave of the Skinwalker to change your identity. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862000/extras/667c6a5ff4bc333397a00c7f98361782.poster.avif?t=1756758554\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862000/extras/667c6a5ff4bc333397a00c7f98361782.webm?t=1756758554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862000/extras/667c6a5ff4bc333397a00c7f98361782.mp4?t=1756758554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flip switches, find keys, unlock doors, activate devices, cut ropes, input patterns, jump gaps, and perform many other tasks to unlock new pathways and find your way through the intricate environments of Elsana. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a break from the main story to explore the unique towns, completing side-quests, buying items, and playing mini-games. Help people, and they may gift accessories to expand your inventory. Meet the seamstress and inspire her to design new outfits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the ancient secrets that have shaped this world using the powers of </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Cave of the Skinwalker</i>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "short_description": "Journey through Elsana as a wizard, warrior, and archer in this fantasy 2D top down action-adventure game. Explore diverse environments, fight enemies, solve puzzles, and save the many regions of the world from hidden dangers. Can you discover the secrets of the Cave of the Skinwalker?",
